  'postpartum',
  'Into Year Three',
  'Two years down. You know more than you think you do.',
  'Notice how much more confident you''ve become at this, even on hard days.',
  'Crossing into the third year often brings a quieter kind of confidence — you''ve done two full years of this, through everything they held. This week is a gentle acknowledgment of that, before the specific themes of this final stretch begin.',
  ARRAY['A settled rhythm that took two years to build','Occasional disbelief at how much has changed since the beginning','A more verbal, opinionated child changing the shape of your days','Continued fatigue, even with more established routines']::text[],
  '{"focus": "Whatever routine has genuinely stuck for you by now.", "tiers": {"heavy": "A few stretches, wherever you are.", "steady": "Your go-to walk or short session.", "feeling_good": "Your established routine, at whatever level you''ve built to."}, "mood_adjustment": "By this stage you likely know your own patterns well — trust them over any generic guidance here.", "safety": "No specific caution this week."}'::jsonb,
  'No specific note this week.',
  'No specific note this week.',
