  'Something that''s just yours doesn''t need to justify itself.',
  'Revisit one hobby or interest that''s been dormant since before or during early motherhood.',
  'By two years in, many mothers find a little more bandwidth returning — enough, sometimes, to revisit an old interest or hobby that got shelved. This week is a gentle nudge to notice if that bandwidth exists for you, and to use it without guilt if it does.',
