  'Notice one comparison you''ve been making, and set it down, even briefly.',
  'Comparing your child''s milestones, behavior, or your own parenting to other families is nearly universal — and rarely helpful. This week is about noticing when comparison creeps in and gently choosing to step back from it.',
  ARRAY['Comparing her development, behavior, or habits to other children''s','Comparing your own parenting choices or capacity to other mothers''','Relief when you catch yourself and choose to let a comparison go','Genuine confidence in your own path, on the days that comes easily']::text[],
