  160,
  'postpartum',
  'How Are You, Really',
  'Almost three years in, checking on yourself is still allowed.',
  'An honest, no-judgment check-in on how you''ve actually been doing.',
  'This is a dedicated pause to ask how you''re really doing — same spirit as Weeks 88 and 100. This project deliberately doesn''t use the term "postpartum depression" this far out, since the window that term is grounded in has long passed — but ongoing low mood, anxiety, or feeling flat for weeks at a time is still worth taking seriously, at any point in motherhood.',
  ARRAY['Genuinely doing okay, worth noticing too, not just hard stretches','A low mood or heaviness that''s lasted longer than a bad week','A sense that yourself has quietly slipped further away','Uncertainty about whether what you''re feeling is worth mentioning to someone']::text[],
  '{"focus": "Movement this week is optional and secondary to the check-in itself.", "tiers": {"heavy": "A few slow breaths before anything else today.", "steady": "A walk alone, with space to think about how you''re doing.", "feeling_good": "Whatever movement feels good — this week the real work is elsewhere."}, "mood_adjustment": "No specific note this week — see the honest check-in below instead.", "safety": "No specific caution this week."}'::jsonb,
  'No specific note this week.',
  'No specific note this week.',
  'No specific note this week.',
  'If exhaustion has felt constant rather than tied to a hard week, that''s worth mentioning below, not just accepting as permanent.',
  '{"heavy_day": "If today is heavy, and this has been a longer pattern, it''s worth reading more about what ongoing low mood or anxiety can look like at this stage, and talking to your doctor or someone you trust. There''s no point at which it''s \"too late\" to ask for support.", "a_little_low": "A little low, if it''s been the pattern more often than not lately, deserves honest attention.", "okay": "If you''re genuinely okay, trust that.", "good": "If you''re doing well, notice what''s been helping.", "really_good": "A really good stretch is worth celebrating fully."}'::jsonb,
  'Whatever your honest answer this week, offer yourself the same care you''d offer a close friend.',
  'Take a few minutes to actually sit with the question "how am I, really."',
  'If this check-in surfaced something heavier than expected, the "Help me prepare to talk to someone" tool in Mental health & support can help you put it into words.',
  'Nearly three years of showing up, in whatever way you have, is a real and significant thing.',
  'If low mood, anxiety, or persistent exhaustion has been ongoing, please don''t wait to reach out — Mental health & support can help you take the next step.',
  'If low mood, anxiety, or persistent exhaustion has been ongoing, raise it directly at your next appointment — maternal mental health support has no expiry date. — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — --',
